183	  <div class="vocab-id">Vocab 0001 &nbsp;/&nbsp; HFT Trading Practice Repo</div>
184	  <h1>Glossary: pybind11 + CMake FetchContent</h1>
185	  <p class="subtitle">Key terms for the C++ extension build system added to this repo. Each entry includes a definition, a project example, a usage sentence, and contrast with similar terms.</p>
186	</header>
187	
188	<div class="term-index">
189	  <a href="#pybind11">pybind11</a>
190	  <a href="#pybind11-module">PYBIND11_MODULE</a>
191	  <a href="#pybind11-add-module">pybind11_add_module</a>
192	  <a href="#fetchcontent">FetchContent</a>
193	  <a href="#scikit-build-core">scikit-build-core</a>
194	  <a href="#pybind11-findpython">PYBIND11_FINDPYTHON</a>
195	  <a href="#editable-install">editable install</a>
196	  <a href="#abi">ABI</a>
197	  <a href="#shared-object">shared object (.so)</a>
198	  <a href="#parity-test">parity test</a>
199	  <a href="#type-caster">type caster</a>
200	</div>
